Ah, yes, I had forgotten about air.  But there are still solutions.  You
could polymorph yourself into a vampire lord and don an amulet of
unchanging for the duration of your stay, for instance.  Also, you *can*
traverse Air without levitation or flight, but it takes approximately
four times as long.  Either you move normally, or you don't move at all;
your movement on Air is *not* randomised.  I admit that doing Air the
hard way is very dangerous.

I never use Water; I use a means of detecting traps and a mixture of
patience and cautious movement, and possibly also the AoY.  I also
believe that levitation Should Not Work for getting across Water (since
water-walking doesn't).

On Fire, true trap-detection is far more important than levitation.

